    - rid: 6774952781063389275
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Why, my magnum opus, of course!

          I came to this
          hotel in the middle of nowhere because I thought it would finally allow
          me to focus.

          Art isn''t done in between parties and drugs,...or
          so my acquaintances insisted before dragging me here with their <b>constant</b>
          negging...'
